  abstract={This paper presents the specifications and the measurement results of conducted immunity requirements tests applied to coupling circuits designed, by authors, for the narrowband Power Line Communication channel measurement. Obtained results showed that the proposed design provides a high safety level to users and measurement devices, and is in compliance with CENELEC immunity requirements in terms of surge tests in both common and differential modes and fast transients tests specifications.},
